## Integration

### Claude Desktop

Add to your Claude Desktop config:
- **Linux**: `~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json`
- **Mac**: `~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json`

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "readwise": {
      "command": "readwise-mcp",
      "env": {
        "READWISE_API_KEY": "your_api_key_here"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

