### Get Branch

```typescript
{
  "tool": "get_branch",
  "arguments": {
    "workspace": "PROJ",
    "repository": "my-repo",
    "branch_name": "feature/new-feature",
    "include_merged_prs": false  // Optional (default: false)
  }
}
