# Step 3: Deploy the MCP Server

## 3.1 Deployment Execution

Since this is a **free-installation deployment** using `npx`, no actual deployment commands are needed. The server will be executed directly via `npx -y @nexus2520/bitbucket-mcp-server` when the MCP client starts it.

